@EDOC_API = http://localhost:5245

GET {{EDOC_API}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Search doctors
GET {{EDOC_API}}/api/doctors?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Register a patient (use a unique email and strong development password)
POST {{EDOC_API}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@example.test",
  "password": "ReplaceWithStrongPassword1!",
  "displayName": "Example Patient"
}

### Login
POST {{EDOC_API}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@example.test",
  "password": "ReplaceWithStrongPassword1!"
}

### Check availability after an administrator provisions a doctor schedule
GET {{EDOC_API}}/api/doctors/1/slots?date=2026-10-26
Accept: application/json
